Cell["\<\
Along t2 you see the decaying, multi-frequency COSY beat pattern, while along \
t1 the Cos and Sin channels oscillate in quadrature (90 degrees out of phase) \
across the indirect evolution grid.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"bb9e10c3-3c0e-1c4d-8b17-203ad090f2c9"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["4. Quadrature Acquisition Methods", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"cfbdd173-8f8a-7a40-988b-e74fe9a57613"],

Cell["\<\
To distinguish positive and negative frequencies (+F1 vs -F1) and obtain pure \
absorption lineshapes in 2D NMR, indirect-dimension quadrature detection is \
required. Signal2D supports six QuadratureMethod modes:
  - \"PhaseModulated\": single complex P-type/N-type dataset without indirect \
phase separation; yields phase-twist lineshapes that cannot be phased to pure \
absorption and are normally plotted in magnitude mode.
  - \"States\": acquires separate \"Cos\" and \"Sin\" datasets shifted by \
-Pi/(2q) in preparation phase; yields mirror-free pure absorption spectra.
  - \"StatesTPPI\": acquires \"Cos\" and \"Sin\" with alternating 180-degree \
preparation and receiver phase, shifting F1 axial artifacts to the spectral \
edge.
  - \"EchoAntiEcho\": acquires \"Echo\" (p1 = -q) and \"AntiEcho\" (p1 = +q) \
coherence pathways and recombines them into a hypercomplex spectrum.
  - \"TPPI\": acquires a single real-modulated matrix with 2*N1 increments at \
half the dwell time (dt1/2); real-only F1 Fourier transformation leaves an \
intrinsic conjugate mirror unless positive/negative halves are separated.
  - \"OversampledStates\": acquires both \"Cos\" and \"Sin\" at 2*N1 \
increments (dt1/2), supporting full mirror-free quadrature over doubled F1 \
bandwidth or projection onto TPPI.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"20c8e496-2ed6-c046-b218-99b7438178dc"],

Cell["\<\
We run the same COSY experiment across all six methods, process them \
identically with FT, and compare channel keys, dimensions, and normalized 2D \
spectra over the same axis window.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2ce1a803-ba9d-b44d-8507-5ccd00be382d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"qMethods", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"\"\<PhaseModulated\>\"", ",", "\"\<States\>\"", 
     ",", "\"\<StatesTPPI\>\"", ",", "\"\<EchoAntiEcho\>\"", 
     ",", "\"\<TPPI\>\"", ",", "\"\<OversampledStates\>\""}], "}"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sigsQ", "=", 
   RowBox[{"AssociationMap", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Signal2D", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"2", "Pi", "800."}], ",", "64"}], "}"}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"2", "Pi", "800."}], ",", "128"}], "}"}], "}"}]}], "}"}],
         ",", 
        RowBox[{"Preparation", "->", 
         RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", "\"\<x\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Mixing", "->", 
         RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", "\"\<x\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"BackgroundGenerator", "->", "Hcosy"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"QuadratureMethod", "->", "#"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"LineBroadening", "->", "22."}]}], "]"}], "&"}], ",", 
     "qMethods"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"specsQ", "=", 
   RowBox[{"AssociationMap", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"FT", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"sigsQ", "[", "#", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"ZeroFill", "->", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"2", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}], "&"}], ",", "qMethods"}],
     "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"TableForm", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"qm", ",", 
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"AssociationQ", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"sigsQ", "[", "qm", "]"}], "[", "\"\<Data\>\"", "]"}], 
          "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"Keys", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"sigsQ", "[", "qm", "]"}], "[", "\"\<Data\>\"", "]"}], 
          "]"}], ",", "\"\<Matrix\>\""}], "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"sigsQ", "[", "qm", "]"}], "[", "\"\<N1\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"MatrixQ", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"sigsQ", "[", "qm", "]"}], "[", "\"\<Data\>\"", "]"}], 
          "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"sigsQ", "[", "qm", "]"}], "[", "\"\<Data\>\"", "]"}], 
          "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"sigsQ", "[", "qm", "]"}], "[", "\"\<Data\>\"", "]"}], "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"specsQ", "[", "qm", "]"}], "[", "\"\<Representation\>\"", 
        "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"NumberForm", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"specsQ", "[", "qm", "]"}], "[", "\"\<RR\>\"", "]"}], 
           "]"}], "]"}], ",", "4"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"qm", ",", "qMethods"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"TableHeadings", "->", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"None", ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<QuadratureMethod\>\"", ",", "\"\<Data Keys\>\"", 
        ",", "\"\<Logical N1\>\"", ",", "\"\<Rows Stored\>\"", 
        ",", "\"\<Representation\>\"", ",", "\"\<Max |RR|\>\""}], "}"}]}], 
     "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[27]:=",ExpressionUUID->"e8b86af1-78f5-dc49-8f1a-d3d3a5956b7d"],

