Cell["\<\
Notice that spFpmf05[\"Frequency1\"] and spFpmf05[\"Frequency2\"] return \
frequency axes in Hz spanning (-SW/2, +SW/2], while \"AngularFrequency1\" and \
\"AngularFrequency2\" return 2 Pi times those frequencies in rad s^-1.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a04058bd-9428-6b4a-8ecb-879327d58939"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["6. Hypercomplex Spectrum2D Objects", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3310a080-854b-4548-a8f1-9c2c001ff934"],

Cell["\<\
A phase-sensitive 2D FT spectrum has two independent imaginary units, i1 (for \
F1) and i2 (for F2), forming a bicomplex matrix S = U + i2 V with U = S_RR + \
i1 S_IR and V = S_RI + i1 S_II. Consequently, Spectrum2D stores four real \
components:
  - \"RR\" (Re/Re): pure absorption along both F1 and F2 when properly phased,
  - \"IR\" (Im/Re): dispersive in F1, absorptive in F2,
  - \"RI\" (Re/Im): absorptive in F1, dispersive in F2,
  - \"II\" (Im/Im): dispersive in both dimensions.
Because U and V carry independent phase planes, F1 and F2 phase corrections \
commute cleanly and can be applied independently after FT using \
PhaseSpectrum2D.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"e7e1435f-a29b-844f-ba70-6c130d4ed8c9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"comps", "=", 
   RowBox[{"specCosy", "[", "\"\<Components\>\"", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\"\<Representation\>\"", "->", 
    RowBox[{"specCosy", "[", "\"\<Representation\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<HypercomplexQ\>\"", "->", 
    RowBox[{"specCosy", "[", "\"\<HypercomplexQ\>\"", "]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<ComponentKeys\>\"", "->", 
    RowBox[{"Keys", "[", "comps", "]"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<Max HypercomplexMagnitude\>\"", "->", 
    RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
     RowBox[{"specCosy", "[", "\"\<HypercomplexMagnitude\>\"", "]"}], 
     "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[49]:=",ExpressionUUID->"ffa99da1-c408-3743-91b6-73617d70d36a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"Representation\"\>", "\[Rule]", "\<\"Hypercomplex\"\>"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"HypercomplexQ\"\>", "\[Rule]", "True"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"ComponentKeys\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\<\"RR\"\>", ",", "\<\"IR\"\>", ",", "\<\"RI\"\>", 
      ",", "\<\"II\"\>"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"Max HypercomplexMagnitude\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    "0.041579251906282665`"}]}], "}"}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.004619721623783*^9},
 CellLabel->"Out[50]=",ExpressionUUID->"e3660923-aeeb-ff4a-960c-89ff99c06088"]
}, Open  ]],

