Cell["\<\
Why is this useful? Native \"TPPI\" discards the orthogonal quadrature \
partner at each t1 point via time-proportional phase increments, so its real \
F1 transform inherently superimposes a small conjugate-mirror wing under \
finite damping or truncation (even when TPPIProcessing -> \"RetainedHalf\", \
\"RealOnly\", \"Staggered\", or \"Hilbert\" extracts the primary half-band). \
\"OversampledStates\" retains both channels, making it ideal whenever you \
want to explore full-bandwidth mirror-free F1 spectra or compare multiple \
processing/TPPI representations from one simulation.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"00731c22-7252-bb4b-bf44-f08fc0368a67"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["10. Summary and Quick Reference", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"017ae26e-8e51-524d-97af-e1227955ce61"],

Cell["\<\
In a typical 2D simulation workflow:
  1. Define the spin system, static Hamiltonian, and pulse sequence stages \
using Signal2D (default QuadratureMethod -> \"States\" gives pure \
phase-sensitive absorption).
  2. Inspect SignalData2D channels, time axes, and metadata before \
processing.
  3. Apply FT with ZeroFill, Apodization or LineBroadening, \
FirstPointMultiplicationFactor, and PhaseCorrection in {F2, F1} order \[AHat]\
\.80\.94 iterating freely without re-running Signal2D.
  4. Inspect hypercomplex components (\"RR\", \"IR\", \"RI\", \"II\") or \
phase errors with PhaseSpectrum2D, optionally switching to StorageMode -> \
\"Compact\" once F2 phasing is final, or using \"OversampledStates\" + \
ProjectToTPPI to compare acquisition schemes from one run.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3549a1da-9dfd-2b43-a40f-71c1c77991e1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {"\<\"Symbol / Option\"\>", "\<\"Role\"\>", "\<\"Typical Values & \
Ordering\"\>"},
    {"\<\"Signal2D[t1, t2, opts]\"\>", "\<\"Simulate 2D NMR time-domain \
data\"\>", "\<\"Returns SignalData2D; timing {{swRad, n}} or {tmin, tmax, dt}\
\"\>"},
    {"\<\"BackgroundGenerator\"\>", "\<\"Static/stage evolution Hamiltonian\"\
\>", "\<\"Operator, superoperator, or 4-stage list {bgPrep, bg1, bgMix, \
bg2}\"\>"},
    {"\<\"Preparation / Mixing\"\>", "\<\"Pulse sequences before/after \
t1\"\>", "\<\"Pulse[...], Delay[...], or list of events\"\>"},
    {"\<\"QuadratureMethod\"\>", "\<\"Indirect quadrature acquisition \
scheme\"\>", "\<\"\\\"States\\\" (default), \\\"StatesTPPI\\\", \
\\\"EchoAntiEcho\\\", \\\"TPPI\\\", \\\"OversampledStates\\\", \
\\\"PhaseModulated\\\"\"\>"},
    {"\<\"SignalData2D[...]\"\>", "\<\"Inspect time-domain signals & metadata\
\"\>", "\<\"\\\"Cos\\\", \\\"Sin\\\", \\\"Echo\\\", \\\"AntiEcho\\\", \
\\\"Time1\\\", \\\"Time2\\\", \\\"Metadata\\\"\"\>"},
    {"\<\"FT[sig, opts]\"\>", "\<\"2D Fourier transform & processing\"\>", \
"\<\"Pairs use {direct, indirect} = {F2, F1} ordering\"\>"},
    {"\<\"ZeroFill / Apodization\"\>", "\<\"Padding & windowing before \
FFT\"\>", "\<\"ZeroFill -> {zf2, zf1}; Apodization / ApplyApodization / \
ApplyLineBroadening\"\>"},
    {"\<\"FirstPointMultiplicationFactor\"\>", "\<\"t = 0 point scaling for \
baseline\"\>", "\<\"Scalar or {f2, f1} (e.g. {0.5, 0.5})\"\>"},
    {"\<\"PhaseCorrection / PhaseSpectrum2D\"\>", "\<\"Zero- and first-order \
phasing\"\>", "\<\"{{ph0F2, ph1F2}, {ph0F1, ph1F1}} in radians\"\>"},
    {"\<\"StorageMode\"\>", "\<\"Post-F2 spectral storage \
representation\"\>", "\<\"\\\"Hypercomplex\\\" (default U + i2 V) or \
\\\"Compact\\\" (U only)\"\>"},
    {"\<\"IndirectBandwidth / TPPIProcessing\"\>", "\<\"Special F1 FT \
controls\"\>", "\<\"\\\"Logical\\\" / \\\"Full\\\" (OversampledStates); \
\\\"RetainedHalf\\\", \\\"RealOnly\\\", \\\"Staggered\\\", \
\\\"Hilbert\\\"\"\>"},
    {"\<\"ProjectToTPPI[sigOS]\"\>", "\<\"Project OversampledStates to TPPI\"\
\>", "\<\"Computes P_n = C_n Cos[n Pi/2] - S_n Sin[n Pi/2]\"\>"},
    {"\<\"Spectrum2D[...]\"\>", "\<\"Inspect hypercomplex spectral data\"\>", \
"\<\"\\\"RR\\\", \\\"IR\\\", \\\"RI\\\", \\\"II\\\", \
\\\"HypercomplexMagnitude\\\", \\\"Frequency1\\\", \\\"Frequency2\\\"\"\>"},
    {"\<\"PlotSpectrum2D / ExtractSlice / ProjectSpectrum2D\"\>", \
"\<\"Visualize & extract 1D slices/projections\"\>", "\<\"Display-only: \
Component, ReverseAxes, PlotRange, ShowProjections\"\>"},
    {"\<\"ReflectSpectrum / ConjugateSpectrum2D / CombineData\"\>", \
"\<\"Modify or combine spectra\"\>", "\<\"Axis -> \\\"F1\\\" | \\\"F2\\\"; \
linear combinations of compatible spectra\"\>"}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}},
   GridBoxBackground->{"Columns" -> {{None}}, "Rows" -> {
       GrayLevel[0.85], {
        GrayLevel[1], 
        RGBColor[0.97, 0.98, 1.]}}},
   GridBoxFrame->{"Columns" -> {{True}}, "Rows" -> {{True}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"8730b402-bab2-7c46-839a-48cc4ab020fb"]
